    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d409">

                <pb facs="0579" n="473" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg473"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consul-General Steinhart to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-09-10"><hi rendition="#italic">September 10,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President here worried because no reply received my message, and asks war vessels
                    be sent immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhart</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul-General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
